<view class="page"><page-header title="{{form.id ? '编辑宠物档案' : '添加宠物'}}" back /><view class="screen-body"><button class="recognition-card" bindtap="recognize" disabled="{{recognizing || saving || loading}}"><p-image wx:if="{{photo}}" image-class="recognition-photo" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view wx:else class="recognition-icon"><p-icon name="image" size="48" /></view><view class="recognition-copy"><view class="recognition-title">{{recognizing ? '正在模拟识别…' : 'AI 拍照识别'}}<text class="mock-badge">Mock</text></view><text class="caption">拍照或选择照片，快速体验建立档案</text></view><p-icon name="arrow" size="26" /></button><view wx:if="{{mockResult}}" class="mock-notice">模拟识别完成，已填入示例信息。品种、年龄和体重不是真实识别结果，请核对修改后保存。</view><text wx:else class="caption recognition-note">演示功能：照片仅保留在本机，不上传识别服务。</text><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty-state">正在读取档案…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="mock-notice">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="loadPet">重试</button></view><view class="pet-form"><view class="form-field"><text>宠物昵称</text><input value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="12" placeholder="它叫什么名字？" disabled="{{loading || saving || recognizing}}" /></view><view class="field-pair"><view class="form-field"><text>类型</text><view class="form-value">猫咪</view></view><view class="form-field"><text>品种</text><input value="{{form.breed}}" data-key="breed" bindinput="input" maxlength="24" placeholder="如：英国短毛猫" disabled="{{loading || saving || recognizing}}" /></view></view><view class="field-pair"><view class="form-field"><text>年龄 <text class="caption">岁</text></text><input type="digit" value="{{form.age}}" data-key="age" bindinput="input" maxlength="4" placeholder="如 2.5" disabled="{{loading || saving || recognizing}}" /></view><view class="form-field"><text>体重 <text class="caption">kg</text></text><input type="digit" value="{{form.weight}}" data-key="weight" bindinput="input" maxlength="5" placeholder="如 4.5" disabled="{{loading || saving || recognizing}}" /></view></view></view><text class="caption">当前支持猫咪档案，年龄与体重请按实际情况填写。</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || recognizing || loading || error}}">保存档案</button></view></view>
